comment author Shinryuu
comment Based on publication 4410 and our v4.1. Wily 6: the stage-start pause uses the Up+Down menu trick and Mega Man reaches the second Item 1 platform one frame sooner (found by our w6prefill study), so the alien door comes 4 frames earlier and the door-aligned alien stays in phase with the q4 health fill. The alien-room ledge platform then inherits a different slot-4 subpixel; three Metal Blades of the Wily Machine fight are thrown in another direction (same frames, same positions, hits and lag frames) so that Wily 6 starts with slot-4 subpixel 0x4E instead of 0xEA, which makes the ledge work. 119 frames faster than publication 4410 in total.
